\b 13. Technical Recommendations for Replit MVP\b0\par
\par
\b Recommended Stack\b0\par
- Frontend + Backend: Next.js\par
- Language: TypeScript\par
- Styling: Tailwind CSS\par
- UI Components: shadcn/ui\par
- Database: PostgreSQL\par
- ORM: Prisma\par
- Auth: Supabase Auth or Auth.js\par
- Storage: Supabase Storage\par
- Deployment/Hosting: Replit for dev/prototype, with optional external DB/storage\par
\par
\b Why this stack\b0\par
- fast to build\par
- good for dashboards and full-stack MVPs\par
- developer-friendly\par
- works well with Replit\par
- scalable enough for early-stage product validation\par
\par
\b 14. Proposed Data Model\b0\par
\par
\b Core Entities\b0\par
- User\par
- Profile\par
