\b Notes\b0\par
- imported rows should be stored separately before final approval if possible\par
- merchant rule memory will help improve auto-categorization over time\par
- uploaded documents should keep metadata such as bank type, upload date, parse status\par
\par
\b 15. Statement Parsing Requirements\b0\par
\par
\b Supported Sources in MVP\b0\par
- BIBD PDF statements\par
- Baiduri PDF statements\par
\par
\b Parsing Requirements\b0\par
- extract transaction rows from text-based PDFs where possible\par
- normalize dates, descriptions, and amounts\par
- support debit/credit identification\par
- support review and correction before import\par
- store raw source file and parsed result metadata\par
\par
\b Parsing Constraints\b0\par
- bank layouts may change\par
- parser should be modular per bank\par
- scanned PDFs may require OCR later, but should not block MVP launch if unsupported initially\par
- system should clearly tell users what formats are currently supported\par
\par
